{"code":"000590","name":"CS홀딩스","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"철강","sector_desc":"철강재 생산·가공. 중국 공급, 원료(철광석·석탄) 가격, 건설·조선 수요에 연동되는 경기 민감 업종입니다.","desc":"동사는 1949년 용접재료 생산 및 판매 목적으로 설립되었으며, 2010년 CS홀딩스(주), 조선선재(주), 조선선재온산(주)로 분할하였음. 동사는 지주회사로서 투자 부문을 담당하며, 자회사로 조선선재(주), 조선선재온산(주), 씨에스로직스(주) 및 해외종속회사를 두고 있음. 지주회사 체제를 통해 책임경영을 정착시키고, 사업부문별 특성에 맞는 신속하고 전문적인 의사결정 체제를 확립하여 경쟁력을 강화하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-29","n_days":300,"close":72000.0,"open":71700.0,"high":72100.0,"low":71000.0,"volume":732,"amount":52704000.0,"ret_1d":0.1391,"gap":-0.2782,"range_pct":1.5278,"ret_5":2.2727,"ret_20":2.2727,"ret_60":17.0732,"ret_120":-10.4478,"ret_250":-12.7273,"ma20":70805.0,"ma60":68426.6667,"ma120":70170.8333,"ma200":73900.5,"close_vs_ma200":-2.5717,"close_vs_ma60":5.2221,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":41.7351,"r2_60":0.653,"slope_120":-18.6842,"r2_120":0.2745,"slope_250":-16.9893,"r2_250":0.4768,"high52":91000.0,"low52":60300.0,"pos_52w":38.1107,"dd_52w":-20.8791,"mdd_1y":-32.8194,"atr14_pct":2.5893,"vol_ann_60":20.195,"vol_avg20":577.05,"vol_ratio20":1.2685,"vr5":1.0251,"vr20":0.6951,"amount_avg5":57645880.0,"amount_avg20":41037175.0,"amount_avg60":45363430.0,"obv_chg20":16.489,"turnover_20":0.9997,"pv_eff_20":2.2735,"rsi14":60.8783,"frgn_net_5":92.0,"inst_net_5":-42.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.008,"inst_net_5_pct":-0.0036,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0043,"frgn_net_20":630.0,"inst_net_20":-12.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0546,"inst_net_20_pct":-0.001,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0535,"frgn_net_60":5632.0,"inst_net_60":69.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.4878,"inst_net_60_pct":0.006,"smart_net_60_pct":0.4938,"frgn_net_120":19581.0,"inst_net_120":-742.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":1.6961,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.0643,"smart_net_120_pct":1.6318,"foreign_ratio":5.16,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.39,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":75.0,"op_margin_q":19.1327,"op_qoq":63.0435,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":20.9677,"rev_yoy":9.8039,"op_trend_4q":15.7692,"fin_period":"202606","roe":7.07,"debt_ratio":8.33,"per":3.54,"pbr":0.22,"di